    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/5cb382a165d44eabfd730713ab1ae13c.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br><strong>Have you ever imagined driving a concrete pump, bulldozer or even a tower crane?</strong> Now it's your time to learn to operate heavy construction machines thanks to Construction Machines SIM: Bridges, buildings and constructor trucks simulator! <br><br>Discover the new construction game where you can<strong> excavate the foundation of a house with realistic machines, pour concrete into the wall panels of a factory with an enormous concrete pump, or test the steadiness of your hands by placing gigantic roof trusses with a mobile crane.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/906fb74349f2d66c6a5a22b7750b6c9c.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br>Explore a world where you'll find a variety of new challenges for the entire fleet of machinery. If you succeed, you'll get bigger jobs that offer you even more possibilities. <strong>Do you want to get to know our heavy construction machines?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Forklift</strong></li><li><strong>Dragline</strong></li><li><strong>Dumper</strong></li><li><strong>ConcreteMixer</strong></li><li><strong>Crane</strong></li><li><strong>Telehandler</strong></li><li><strong>Compactor</strong></li><li><strong>Excavator</strong></li><li><strong>Wheel Loader</strong></li><li><strong>LoaderTruck</strong></li></ul><br>Unlimited missions await you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/6110d8bf90785464806db05917c0702d.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br><strong>Unlimited missions</strong> guarantee you hours of fun.<br><strong>10 construction machines</strong> modeled in 3D for added realism.<br><strong>Realistic vehicle controls</strong><br><strong>Sound effects</strong> recorded from the original machines.<br>A dynamic mission system that <strong>provides unlimited fun.</strong><br>Sophisticated experience system to help <strong>you progress through the game.</strong><br><br>It's time to get to work. <strong>Play now!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/5cb382a165d44eabfd730713ab1ae13c.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br><strong>Have you ever imagined driving a concrete pump, bulldozer or even a tower crane?</strong> Now it's your time to learn to operate heavy construction machines thanks to Construction Machines SIM: Bridges, buildings and constructor trucks simulator! <br><br>Discover the new construction game where you can<strong> excavate the foundation of a house with realistic machines, pour concrete into the wall panels of a factory with an enormous concrete pump, or test the steadiness of your hands by placing gigantic roof trusses with a mobile crane.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/906fb74349f2d66c6a5a22b7750b6c9c.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br>Explore a world where you'll find a variety of new challenges for the entire fleet of machinery. If you succeed, you'll get bigger jobs that offer you even more possibilities. <strong>Do you want to get to know our heavy construction machines?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Forklift</strong></li><li><strong>Dragline</strong></li><li><strong>Dumper</strong></li><li><strong>ConcreteMixer</strong></li><li><strong>Crane</strong></li><li><strong>Telehandler</strong></li><li><strong>Compactor</strong></li><li><strong>Excavator</strong></li><li><strong>Wheel Loader</strong></li><li><strong>LoaderTruck</strong></li></ul><br>Unlimited missions await you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884470/extras/6110d8bf90785464806db05917c0702d.avif?t=1651734037\" /></div><br><br><strong>Unlimited missions</strong> guarantee you hours of fun.<br><strong>10 construction machines</strong> modeled in 3D for added realism.<br><strong>Realistic vehicle controls</strong><br><strong>Sound effects</strong> recorded from the original machines.<br>A dynamic mission system that <strong>provides unlimited fun.</strong><br>Sophisticated experience system to help <strong>you progress through the game.</strong><br><br>It's time to get to work. <strong>Play now!</strong>",
